asr-000635
01:03:35.340 --> 01:03:38.660
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Yung...

asr-000636
01:03:39.320 --> 01:03:44.820
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa CAV and BOL, there's no amount stated with respect to the socioeconomic package

asr-000637
01:03:44.820 --> 01:03:47.240
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: that the government is supposed to provide.

asr-000638
01:03:47.360 --> 01:03:49.620
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Unfortunately, I would say unfortunately,

asr-000639
01:03:50.480 --> 01:03:54.280
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: there was an amount eventually declared

asr-000640
01:03:54.280 --> 01:03:57.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: that each decommissioned combatant is supposed to get.

asr-000641
01:03:57.640 --> 01:04:02.680
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: One million pesos worth of socioeconomic package.

asr-000642
01:04:03.820 --> 01:04:10.840
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, yun po ang naging malaking challenge sa aspeto po ng gobyerno.

asr-000643
01:04:12.120 --> 01:04:15.880
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nang umupo po ako, nakita natin may marami pong programa,

asr-000644
01:04:16.080 --> 01:04:19.200
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: pero may mga challenges po tayong kailangan ma-address.

asr-000645
01:04:19.840 --> 01:04:24.720
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Unang-una po, sa side po ng UPAPRU,

asr-000646
01:04:24.720 --> 01:04:26.720
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: yung monitoring.

asr-000647
01:04:27.640 --> 01:04:29.920
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, monitoring lang po kami sa karamihan nitong mga

asr-000648
01:04:29.920 --> 01:04:33.260
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: socioeconomic package na ito.

asr-000649
01:04:34.080 --> 01:04:35.880
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa socioeconomic package,

asr-000650
01:04:36.960 --> 01:04:37.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ay...

asr-000651
01:04:38.700 --> 01:04:43.260
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pag tinatanong namin ng isang ahensya,

asr-000652
01:04:44.300 --> 01:04:45.380
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: sabihin natin, Dole,

asr-000653
01:04:46.260 --> 01:04:48.440
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: nakakasiguro ba kayo nang binigyan nyo

asr-000654
01:04:48.440 --> 01:04:50.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ng...

asr-000655
01:04:51.700 --> 01:04:56.360
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: tulong ng programa ninyo o anumang ahensya

asr-000656
01:04:57.640 --> 01:04:59.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ang naging problema po ay

asr-000657
01:04:59.640 --> 01:05:02.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: data privacy.

asr-000658
01:05:02.640 --> 01:05:06.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Hindi po nagkaroon ng data sharing agreement.

asr-000659
01:05:06.640 --> 01:05:12.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, nagkakaroon po ng problema na may binibigay na tulong,

asr-000660
01:05:12.640 --> 01:05:17.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: yung validation process ang naging very challenging part.

asr-000661
01:05:17.640 --> 01:05:22.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kaya medyo mabagal ng konti yung kanyang implementation.

asr-000662
01:05:22.640 --> 01:05:25.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At yan po yung ina-address namin ngayon

asr-000663
01:05:25.640 --> 01:05:27.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: para magkaroon ng...

asr-000664
01:05:27.640 --> 01:05:29.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: data sharing agreement.

asr-000665
01:05:29.640 --> 01:05:31.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kasi mahirap nga naman kung...

asr-000666
01:05:31.640 --> 01:05:32.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ah...

asr-000667
01:05:32.640 --> 01:05:34.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: walang agreement, no?

asr-000668
01:05:34.640 --> 01:05:35.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Na...

asr-000669
01:05:35.640 --> 01:05:36.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ah...

asr-000670
01:05:36.640 --> 01:05:38.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ng mga ahensya para masiguro na

asr-000671
01:05:38.640 --> 01:05:40.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ang datos ay parehas.

asr-000672
01:05:40.640 --> 01:05:42.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang susunod po ay...

asr-000673
01:05:42.640 --> 01:05:43.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: itong pasihan,

asr-000674
01:05:43.640 --> 01:05:45.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: yung napirmahan po ng

asr-000675
01:05:45.640 --> 01:05:46.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: peace implementing panel

asr-000676
01:05:46.640 --> 01:05:49.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: between the GPH and the MILF.

asr-000677
01:05:49.640 --> 01:05:51.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, ang nakasaad po dito,

asr-000678
01:05:51.640 --> 01:05:53.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: 100,000 po yung pesos yung...

asr-000679
01:05:53.640 --> 01:05:55.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: yung cash na naibigay.

asr-000680
01:05:55.640 --> 01:05:56.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: But the rest,

asr-000681
01:05:56.640 --> 01:05:58.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ano po siya, ah...

asr-000682
01:05:58.640 --> 01:06:01.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: regular program ng gobyerno.

asr-000683
01:06:01.640 --> 01:06:02.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ah...

asr-000684
01:06:02.640 --> 01:06:04.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: PhilHealth,

asr-000685
01:06:04.640 --> 01:06:05.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ah...

asr-000686
01:06:05.640 --> 01:06:06.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: civil registration,

asr-000687
01:06:06.640 --> 01:06:08.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: health insurance,

asr-000688
01:06:08.640 --> 01:06:09.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ah...

asr-000689
01:06:09.640 --> 01:06:10.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: etc.

asr-000690
01:06:10.640 --> 01:06:12.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pwede po naming ibigay.

asr-000691
01:06:12.640 --> 01:06:14.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pero pag tinitingnan po natin yung package dito,

asr-000692
01:06:14.640 --> 01:06:17.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: medyo hindi responsive sa mga edad na...

asr-000693
01:06:17.640 --> 01:06:19.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ng decommissioned combatants.

asr-000694
01:06:19.640 --> 01:06:22.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, isa rin po sa naging hadlang ito, no?

asr-000695
01:06:22.640 --> 01:06:24.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, karamihan dito,

asr-000696
01:06:24.640 --> 01:06:27.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: eh, 46 and, ah...

asr-000697
01:06:27.640 --> 01:06:30.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: basically, around 53 na siguro sila ngayon.

asr-000698
01:06:30.640 --> 01:06:33.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Mahirap na pong ipatesta pa natin yun

asr-000699
01:06:33.640 --> 01:06:36.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: hanggang 66 years old.

asr-000700
01:06:36.640 --> 01:06:40.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, ang bulk ng mga combatants, eh medyo

asr-000701
01:06:40.640 --> 01:06:43.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: hindi nagtutugma yung edad sa package.

asr-000702
01:06:43.640 --> 01:06:46.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, marami pong tinitingnan natin

asr-000703
01:06:46.640 --> 01:06:52.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: mga pwedeng gawin para po mapabilis yung, ah...

asr-000704
01:06:52.640 --> 01:06:53.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: yung...

asr-000705
01:06:53.640 --> 01:06:55.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: decommissioning, ah...

asr-000706
01:06:55.640 --> 01:06:57.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: part ng, ah...

asr-000707
01:06:57.640 --> 01:07:00.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ng usaping pangkapayapaan with the MILF.

asr-000708
01:07:00.640 --> 01:07:03.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang naging hadlang naman po, eh,

asr-000709
01:07:03.640 --> 01:07:07.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: pagupo ko, wala pong chairman sa

asr-000710
01:07:07.640 --> 01:07:10.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: peace implementing panel representing the GPH.

asr-000711
01:07:10.640 --> 01:07:14.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, nag-resign po yung chair

asr-000712
01:07:14.640 --> 01:07:16.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: February of this year.

asr-000713
01:07:16.640 --> 01:07:21.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At ang sabi ng MILF, eh, suspend muna yung

asr-000714
01:07:21.640 --> 01:07:22.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: kahit anong activity.

asr-000715
01:07:22.640 --> 01:07:26.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kahit anong activity sa normalization track.

asr-000716
01:07:26.640 --> 01:07:27.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Natigil po yan.

asr-000717
01:07:27.640 --> 01:07:30.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, nag-antay po tayo ng, ah...

asr-000718
01:07:30.640 --> 01:07:31.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ma-appoint.

asr-000719
01:07:31.640 --> 01:07:35.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nag-assure po ako sa kanila na may ma-appoint na kapalit

asr-000720
01:07:35.640 --> 01:07:41.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: para magpatuloy yung peace implementing panel

asr-000721
01:07:41.640 --> 01:07:44.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: sa regular na meeting, regular na usapin.

asr-000722
01:07:44.640 --> 01:07:45.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ah...

asr-000723
01:07:45.640 --> 01:07:50.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kasi lahat ng gawain dito dapat bilateral, hindi unilateral.

asr-000724
01:07:50.640 --> 01:07:51.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ah...

asr-000725
01:07:51.640 --> 01:07:55.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nung July 15, finally po nagkaroon ng chair

asr-000726
01:07:55.640 --> 01:08:00.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ang peace implementing panel na ako rin ang na-appoint.

asr-000727
01:08:00.640 --> 01:08:04.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, dalawa po yung hinawakan kong posisyon

asr-000728
01:08:04.640 --> 01:08:08.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: bilang kalihim ng OPAPRO at bilang chairperson ng

asr-000729
01:08:08.640 --> 01:08:13.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: GPH panel sa peace implementing panel, ah...

asr-000730
01:08:13.640 --> 01:08:16.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: with the MILF.

asr-000731
01:08:16.640 --> 01:08:19.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Meron po kaming, ah... nag-meeting pa lang po kami

asr-000732
01:08:19.640 --> 01:08:20.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: sa Kuala Lumpur.

asr-000733
01:08:20.640 --> 01:08:23.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: There were seven items that we were supposed to agree on.

asr-000734
01:08:23.640 --> 01:08:25.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Five were eventually approved.

asr-000735
01:08:25.640 --> 01:08:26.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ah...

asr-000736
01:08:26.640 --> 01:08:29.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: We're very thankful to our partners, the MILF.

asr-000737
01:08:29.640 --> 01:08:33.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: We had a very short meeting and yet very productive one

asr-000738
01:08:33.640 --> 01:08:36.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: given that, ah...

asr-000739
01:08:36.640 --> 01:08:40.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: out of the seven items, five were approved.

asr-000740
01:08:40.640 --> 01:08:41.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ah...

asr-000741
01:08:41.640 --> 01:08:45.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At dito po, ah... yung mga na-aprubahan na yan

asr-000742
01:08:45.640 --> 01:08:48.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: kasama po yung konting adjustment sa socio-economic package

asr-000743
01:08:48.640 --> 01:08:49.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: na mas responsive sa kanila.

asr-000744
01:08:49.640 --> 01:08:51.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ah...

asr-000745
01:08:51.640 --> 01:08:54.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Hindi po namin ito nga, ah... naisa lang.

asr-000746
01:08:54.640 --> 01:09:01.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Muna kasi hindi kami sigurado kung papapayag ng adjustment yung, ah...

asr-000747
01:09:01.640 --> 01:09:02.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: MILF.

asr-000748
01:09:02.640 --> 01:09:05.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: September 25 po, nag-meeting kami sa Kuala Lumpur.

asr-000749
01:09:05.640 --> 01:09:10.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nagpapasalamat din po kami sa Malaysia sa kanilang pag-host, ah...

asr-000750
01:09:10.640 --> 01:09:13.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ng meeting ng, ah... MILF at ang GPH.

asr-000751
01:09:13.640 --> 01:09:18.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At, ah... na-aprubahan po ito ng konting adjustment.

asr-000752
01:09:18.640 --> 01:09:23.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Dito sa existing na socio-economic package na mas responsive.

asr-000753
01:09:23.640 --> 01:09:25.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ah... ah...

asr-000754
01:09:25.640 --> 01:09:27.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Yes, may mga kailangan pa po kami rito.

asr-000755
01:09:27.640 --> 01:09:33.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pero once nagawa po natin ito, mapapabilis po yung ating, ah...

asr-000756
01:09:33.640 --> 01:09:36.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: decommissioning ng weapons, ano ah...

asr-000757
01:09:36.640 --> 01:09:43.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: sa, ah... phase four niya, hopefully by 2027.

asr-000758
01:09:43.640 --> 01:09:46.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Doon nangailangan pa kami ng konting oras dito

asr-000759
01:09:46.640 --> 01:09:51.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: sa pag-submit ng additional proposal ng aming, ah... opisina.

asr-000760
01:09:51.640 --> 01:09:53.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Thank you po.

asr-000761
01:09:53.640 --> 01:09:59.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In short, ah... 14,000 ang tinitignan natin left to decommission.

asr-000762
01:09:59.640 --> 01:10:03.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And, ah... what I understand, ah...

asr-000763
01:10:03.640 --> 01:10:09.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: part of the challenge is yung napangakong 1 million. Tama?

asr-000764
01:10:09.640 --> 01:10:15.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, ah... yun ang, ah...

asr-000765
01:10:15.640 --> 01:10:19.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ang, ah... nagiging challenge.

asr-000766
01:10:19.640 --> 01:10:26.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah... pag 1 million of that 14 is, ah... lumalabas 14 billion.

asr-000767
01:10:26.640 --> 01:10:28.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama?

asr-000768
01:10:28.640 --> 01:10:30.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah... ang kakailanganin natin.

asr-000769
01:10:30.640 --> 01:10:34.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Assuming that will be given to the combatants.

asr-000770
01:10:34.640 --> 01:10:35.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No?

asr-000771
01:10:35.640 --> 01:10:39.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah... and then tinitignan ko doon sa budget ninyo.

asr-000772
01:10:39.640 --> 01:10:41.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah... although your budget grew, no?

asr-000773
01:10:41.640 --> 01:10:43.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: About 9 billion na siya ngayon.

asr-000774
01:10:43.640 --> 01:10:44.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah...

asr-000775
01:10:44.640 --> 01:10:47.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: majority of which pupunta sa, ah...

asr-000776
01:10:47.640 --> 01:10:49.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ah... pamana program. No?

asr-000777
01:10:49.640 --> 01:10:54.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah... 6 billion out of the 9 billion will go to the pamana program.

asr-000778
01:10:54.640 --> 01:10:57.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And the pamana program, ah...

asr-000779
01:10:57.640 --> 01:10:59.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: nakakalat to sa iba-ibang programa.

asr-000780
01:10:59.640 --> 01:11:04.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sa, ah... educational assistance, housing, roads.

asr-000781
01:11:04.640 --> 01:11:08.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Roads is about 3.7 billion na eh. No?

asr-000782
01:11:08.640 --> 01:11:12.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No? So, in other words, in... in short, from what I'm reading here,

asr-000783
01:11:12.640 --> 01:11:15.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: yung ah... budget pupunta dito sa pamana program.

asr-000784
01:11:15.640 --> 01:11:24.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung pamana program is meant naman to, ah... sustain the peace efforts on the ground.

asr-000785
01:11:24.640 --> 01:11:28.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama po ba? Ganyan ang direction ng pamana eh, no?

asr-000786
01:11:28.640 --> 01:11:35.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah... para nga may development, para may economic activity, ah... and ah...

asr-000787
01:11:35.640 --> 01:11:38.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ma-sustain, no? In gains of peace.

asr-000788
01:11:38.640 --> 01:11:40.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang kulang dito sa budget ninyo is for that decommissioning.

asr-000789
01:11:40.640 --> 01:11:43.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama?

asr-000790
01:11:43.640 --> 01:11:49.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Magkano ang naka-allocate for decommissioning in your 9 billion budget?

asr-000791
01:11:49.640 --> 01:11:54.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Um... this is something that, ah...

asr-000792
01:11:54.640 --> 01:12:01.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: we, as of the moment, cannot really divulge, ah... the... the proposal

asr-000793
01:12:01.640 --> 01:12:08.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: because it's a working process given that the approval on the part of the MILF, ah...

asr-000794
01:12:08.640 --> 01:12:09.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ah...

asr-000795
01:12:10.640 --> 01:12:16.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: then somewhat concurring to the proposal was last September 25.

asr-000796
01:12:16.640 --> 01:12:23.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: If, ah... may... may... if the good chairperson will allow a 5-minute recess,

asr-000797
01:12:23.640 --> 01:12:27.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: I can perhaps go... perhaps go there and brief you a little bit about it

asr-000798
01:12:27.640 --> 01:12:32.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: so you'll have an idea of what, ah... the proposal is what's going to be.

asr-000799
