asr-001630
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:21.200
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa pag-respeto sa proseso at pagpapasalamat sa ating mahal ng Pangulo na hindi makikialam sa pagpili ng kanilang leader dahil palagi po nating panindigan dito, ang hugot po ng BOL is self-determination and each one of us should respect that, allow them to choose their leaders.

asr-001631
01:30:21.200 --> 01:30:37.920
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: And they're very thankful to the national government for providing them the space for them to select their own leaders, for them to somewhat determine their future. They want a progressive Mindanao.

asr-001632
01:30:38.320 --> 01:30:47.520
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: In fact, for almost five years po nag-probo no community development work po ako sa BARM, helping 27 local government units.

asr-001633
01:30:48.660 --> 01:30:50.680
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang battle cry po ngayon, tama.

asr-001634
01:30:51.200 --> 01:30:55.120
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa Senator JB, chairperson po natin.

asr-001635
01:30:55.760 --> 01:31:07.700
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang battle cry po ngayon sa Basilan, Basulta, Basilan, Sulu, Tawi-Tawi, kahit wala na po yung Sulu, hindi naman po natin pwedeng iwala yun, is from terrorism to tourism.

asr-001636
01:31:08.680 --> 01:31:10.800
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Naka-focus talaga sila sa turismo ngayon.

asr-001637
01:31:11.120 --> 01:31:20.260
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: And in the Butig area, what used to be Abu Bakar, dinatawag natin Camp Abu Bakar, tawag po natin ngayon is Eranun Development Corridor.

asr-001638
01:31:20.260 --> 01:31:26.660
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kasama po dyan ang Parang, Matanog, Barira, and Buldon.

asr-001639
01:31:27.640 --> 01:31:31.540
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang battle cry po nila sa area ngayon is from war zone to economic zone.

asr-001640
01:31:31.540 --> 01:31:41.760
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: I can provide you a copy of the video that was presented in Parang.

asr-001641
01:31:43.180 --> 01:31:46.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kasi ililipat po doon ang kanilang government center.

asr-001642
01:31:47.300 --> 01:31:48.560
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: BGC din ang pangalan.

asr-001643
01:31:49.640 --> 01:31:50.240
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pang-SAMON.

asr-001644
01:31:50.260 --> 01:31:52.480
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Moro Government Center.

asr-001645
01:31:54.920 --> 01:31:58.240
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang pangalan naman ng lugar is Moro Global Metropolis.

asr-001646
01:31:59.120 --> 01:32:03.300
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Meron po silang Malaysian na mga investor who's going to develop.

asr-001647
01:32:04.120 --> 01:32:05.440
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: 205 hectares po yun.

asr-001648
01:32:06.160 --> 01:32:09.260
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang biro ko po nga eh, kung matapos na yan, mukhang masarap tumira doon.

asr-001649
01:32:09.720 --> 01:32:11.500
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang inspiration is Putrajaya.

asr-001650
01:32:12.200 --> 01:32:13.940
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: I have a copy of the video.

asr-001651
01:32:14.140 --> 01:32:19.260
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: I can provide our senators present this afternoon a copy of it.

asr-001652
01:32:19.260 --> 01:32:26.320
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At sa yung normalization process natin ngayon, ang focus po natin.

asr-001653
01:32:27.120 --> 01:32:31.040
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pagkatapos po ng pagpili nila ng mga leader nila, tapos na po yung political trap.

asr-001654
01:32:31.900 --> 01:32:37.220
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa normalization process, socioeconomic development, yung individual na ipipresent ko sa inyo mamaya.

asr-001655
01:32:38.460 --> 01:32:46.020
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Yung sa camp transformation, ito po yung iniingin namin, infrastructure support, social development, housing support.

asr-001656
01:32:46.020 --> 01:32:49.240
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: We're going to work closely with all the multinationals, multilaterals.

asr-001657
01:32:49.260 --> 01:32:55.820
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Working in the area to ensure that each one is coordinated and it should be orchestrated as well.

asr-001658
01:32:56.280 --> 01:33:00.940
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kasi mahirap yung daming pumupunta doon pero halos para pares ang ginagawa.

asr-001659
01:33:01.520 --> 01:33:08.600
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sinisiguro po namin and we would like to invite our good senators perhaps give us a month.

asr-001660
01:33:09.680 --> 01:33:11.400
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pwede po kayong bumisita sa office namin.

asr-001661
01:33:11.540 --> 01:33:14.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Makikita po ninyo lahat ng ginagawa po ng UPAPRO real time.

asr-001662
01:33:14.640 --> 01:33:16.220
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Mga iba kami ang activity po kami.

asr-001663
01:33:16.900 --> 01:33:18.540
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: To include mga pamana project.

asr-001664
01:33:18.540 --> 01:33:25.840
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Naka-Geo tag po yun at may gun chart na po yun para at least alam ng kahit sinong pumunta doon na estado ng bawat proyekto.

asr-001665
01:33:26.600 --> 01:33:30.700
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa camp transformation po, infrastructure, social development, housing support.

asr-001666
01:33:30.800 --> 01:33:31.980
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: We're working closely with Minda.

asr-001667
01:33:32.600 --> 01:33:34.980
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Meron pong MOU na napirmaan very recently.

asr-001668
01:33:35.920 --> 01:33:37.680
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Transitional justice and reconciliation.

asr-001669
01:33:37.960 --> 01:33:40.560
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Tapos na po yung parcelary inventory project.

asr-001670
01:33:40.660 --> 01:33:41.580
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nailunch na po ito.

asr-001671
01:33:42.460 --> 01:33:45.580
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kung may sobra po po tayo, bigyan natin ng kopya ang ating mga...

asr-001672
01:33:45.580 --> 01:33:54.260
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Mga senators natin, ating senate president, ating chairperson ng finance committee.

asr-001673
01:33:55.960 --> 01:33:58.560
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Truth and justice commission, the TGR bill.

asr-001674
01:33:59.960 --> 01:34:04.580
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang suggestion po ni speaker Bojidina.

asr-001675
01:34:05.720 --> 01:34:12.300
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pwede daw kausapin din si Senate President Win Gatchalian para isa na lang po yung pag-draft.

asr-001676
01:34:12.300 --> 01:34:14.300
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Para mas mapabilis po yung...

asr-001677
01:34:15.580 --> 01:34:19.860
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Para po makompleto na natin ang ating sinusulong.

asr-001678
01:34:20.000 --> 01:34:22.840
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Tapos po dyan eh, nakiusap din po kami.

asr-001679
01:34:25.020 --> 01:34:28.360
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pinarating namin ang mga problema po sa baba sa Korte Suprema.

asr-001680
01:34:29.060 --> 01:34:31.940
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At nakiusap din po kami sa Department of Justice.

asr-001681
01:34:32.540 --> 01:34:34.360
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nailunch na rin po ang guidelines.

asr-001682
01:34:35.180 --> 01:34:40.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kasi wala pong klarong palisya sa pag-ayos po ng RIDO at tribal conflict.

asr-001683
01:34:40.920 --> 01:34:42.680
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nagpapasalamat din po tayo sa DOJ.

asr-001684
01:34:42.680 --> 01:34:45.360
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Dahil nakakapekto po yun sa kapayapaan din sa Mindanao.

asr-001685
01:34:45.580 --> 01:34:52.400
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At natapos na po, nasa mid ng Department of Justice nung September 30.

asr-001686
01:34:53.000 --> 01:35:04.260
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ang next step nito eh, siyempre yung sa justice cluster ng bansa eh may pasok na sa judicial system natin.

asr-001687
01:35:04.260 --> 01:35:06.400
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At malaki pong may tutulong nito.

asr-001688
01:35:07.060 --> 01:35:13.300
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kasi kahit po naayos natin itong mga grupong RIDO naman po ang nagiging problema.

asr-001689
01:35:13.700 --> 01:35:15.260
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At nagpapasalamat po tayo sa...

asr-001690
01:35:15.580 --> 01:35:17.560
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nagpapasalamat po tayo sa DOJ. Malaki pong tutulong ito.

asr-001691
01:35:18.400 --> 01:35:26.280
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nasa Saligang Batas naman din po natin ang pag-ayos ng conflict customary law ang ginagamit po natin.

asr-001692
01:35:26.960 --> 01:35:27.440
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So...

asr-001693
