Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I just, I just slipped my mind kung ano yung rason kung bakit.

asr-001703
01:36:15.580 --> 01:36:16.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siyempre siya nagsara.

asr-001704
01:36:20.160 --> 01:36:23.420
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Believe ako sa ating butihing chairperson.

asr-001705
01:36:23.820 --> 01:36:27.200
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Tama po yun. Ang laki pong plantation na yun.

asr-001706
01:36:27.800 --> 01:36:29.080
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa Camp Bader po yun.

asr-001707
01:36:29.540 --> 01:36:30.160
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa Bader.

asr-001708
01:36:30.220 --> 01:36:31.040
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: It's a conflict area.

asr-001709
01:36:31.040 --> 01:36:32.060
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa Maguindanao Sur.

asr-001710
01:36:32.160 --> 01:36:34.700
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Sa kampo, isa po yan sa six camps.

asr-001711
01:36:35.100 --> 01:36:44.120
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: That's why ako nangyayayang, Mr. President, kasi ito na yung nagbibigay livelihood as alternate doon sa mga dating rebelde.

asr-001712
01:36:44.120 --> 01:36:54.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tapos maganda na yung hanap buhay nila, 5,000 of them, biglang nagsara so what can we do, can we try to revive this kasi sayang ito eh.

asr-001713
01:36:54.880 --> 01:37:00.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dahil alam niya, sa totoo lang kinakabahan din ako nung nandun ako kasi mag alas 5 na eh, nakamotor lang ako doon.

asr-001714
01:37:01.480 --> 01:37:06.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kumataw nga ako, kasi baka umabot na ng 5 o'clock maggagabi na.

asr-001715
01:37:06.360 --> 01:37:10.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero I mean happy sila dahil nagdalaw. It's a good boost to them.

asr-001716
01:37:11.120 --> 01:37:13.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lalo na sabi nga ni Chief Minister.

asr-001717
01:37:14.120 --> 01:37:15.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa amin makakuha.

asr-001718
01:37:15.640 --> 01:37:20.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I mean, senador ka, national official, visiting us, nakamotor, so it's a good.

asr-001719
01:37:21.140 --> 01:37:25.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero yun lang, anong in-update there, Sekmel, para matulungan natin?

asr-001720
01:37:25.120 --> 01:37:26.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nangyayay ako, 5,000 yun eh.

asr-001721
01:37:27.060 --> 01:37:29.780
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nagkaroon lang po ng problema yung magkasosyo doon.

asr-001722
01:37:30.640 --> 01:37:39.120
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, naghahanap po tayo ng posibleng mag-assume ng plantasyon na yun.

asr-001723
01:37:39.400 --> 01:37:39.840
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Napakalaki.

asr-001724
01:37:40.860 --> 01:37:42.800
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Napakalaki, ang daming natutulungan.

asr-001725
01:37:43.420 --> 01:37:43.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maganda na po.

asr-001726
01:37:43.880 --> 01:37:44.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nagyayay ako eh.

asr-001727
01:37:44.420 --> 01:37:45.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maganda naman yun.

asr-001728
01:37:45.040 --> 01:37:45.719
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pwede ba natin makaisa?

asr-001729
01:37:45.719 --> 01:37:46.920
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kompleto yun. Pati yung saging.

asr-001730
01:37:47.040 --> 01:37:47.340
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Yes.

asr-001731
01:37:47.500 --> 01:37:48.220
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kompleto po yun.

asr-001732
01:37:48.880 --> 01:37:51.160
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nagkaroon lang po ng problema yung investor doon.

asr-001733
01:37:51.160 --> 01:37:55.400
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Hindi ko privy sa dahilan talaga.

asr-001734
01:37:55.620 --> 01:38:03.160
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pero hinahanapan po natin, sinasabi natin sa mga nasa negosyong yan to consider.

asr-001735
01:38:04.020 --> 01:38:07.400
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Nung inantay lang kasi nila yung maging resulta ng eleksyon.

asr-001736
01:38:09.420 --> 01:38:12.160
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Hopefully, after mag-umpisa na po ang...

asr-001737
01:38:12.160 --> 01:38:14.660
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Hopefully, ito ang de-resolved.

asr-001738
01:38:15.240 --> 01:38:17.240
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: May mga interesado po. Maganda yun.

asr-001739
01:38:17.240 --> 01:38:20.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di rin madali magdibigyan pa po sa 5,000.

asr-001740
01:38:20.980 --> 01:38:24.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Especially, most of them are former rebels.

asr-001741
01:38:25.240 --> 01:38:26.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa kampo mismo.

asr-001742
01:38:26.140 --> 01:38:27.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tama, sa kampo mismo.

asr-001743
01:38:27.560 --> 01:38:33.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tapos may isa rin silang, I remember that they wanted, they were proposing parang bypass road

asr-001744
01:38:33.840 --> 01:38:38.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that would link Maguindanao to Sultan Kudarat na mapapabilis.

asr-001745
01:38:39.720 --> 01:38:42.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito yung mga, Mr. President eh.

asr-001746
01:38:42.160 --> 01:38:50.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito yung mga infrastructure that I think will really open up and will really stimulate economic growth sa area.

asr-001747
01:38:50.880 --> 01:38:54.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yan ang talagang, alam ni SPN, talagang yan ang aking...

asr-001748
01:38:54.200 --> 01:38:59.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That has been my advocacy, yung infra-development because it will stimulate economic growth.

asr-001749
01:39:00.260 --> 01:39:05.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Can you find out na, Sekmel, or kung alam niyo yung details na wala sa isip ko kung sa Maguindanao yun,

asr-001750
01:39:05.960 --> 01:39:11.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: going to bypass, going through, alam ko sa mga plantation, going to Sultan Kudarat para mapaagana.

asr-001751
01:39:11.180 --> 01:39:12.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi na yung...

asr-001752
01:39:12.160 --> 01:39:13.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Iikot pa na malayo, diretsyo na.

asr-001753
01:39:14.120 --> 01:39:21.380
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Actually, nagpapaschedule na po kami ng meeting sa DPWH, konsulta sa kanilang planning office.

asr-001754
01:39:22.160 --> 01:39:30.440
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Tama po yung sinabi nyo at kasama din po dyan ang pag-connect ng, yung Iranun Development Corridor,

asr-001755
01:39:30.780 --> 01:39:33.080
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: ang tawag din lang yung Iranun Development Council,

asr-001756
01:39:34.120 --> 01:39:39.160
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: nasa sa ligang batas naman natin, nasa local code at in-adapt ng Bangsamoro Local Code,

asr-001757
01:39:39.160 --> 01:39:41.180
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: yung inter-local collaboration.

asr-001758
01:39:42.160 --> 01:39:48.100
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, nag-isa-isa, naging inspirasyon po yung Iranun Development Council.

asr-001759
01:39:48.280 --> 01:39:51.640
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Ngayon, may SUDC, ito naman yung sa Butig.

asr-001760
01:39:52.720 --> 01:39:53.920
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Limang bayan naman sila.

asr-001761
01:39:54.800 --> 01:40:00.840
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Tapos, yung dito sa Maguindanao, sa Datupi, sama rin sila.

asr-001762
01:40:00.960 --> 01:40:06.900
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, may proposal, tama po yung sinabi ni Chairperson, Your Honor, tama po yung sinabi nyo.

asr-001763
01:40:08.000 --> 01:40:09.900
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At yung kalsada from...

asr-001764
01:40:12.160 --> 01:40:16.460
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Parang, papuntang Diretso ng Marawi.

asr-001765
01:40:17.300 --> 01:40:21.000
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Malaki pong epekto noon ng infrastrukturang yun.

asr-001766
01:40:21.760 --> 01:40:26.480
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: In fact, pag nangyari po ito, ang parang magiging city po ito.

asr-001767
01:40:27.040 --> 01:40:31.460
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Pero hindi nga lang pwedeng tawagin parang city, parang ang sama ng dating eh.

asr-001768
01:40:31.880 --> 01:40:33.340
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Parang city. City o parang.

asr-001769
01:40:33.760 --> 01:40:38.320
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, kasi parang, pag sinabi mong parang city, mukhang walang maniniwala eh.

asr-001770
01:40:38.320 --> 01:40:41.620
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: So, ang biroan namin ni Mayor Iba eh.

asr-001771
01:40:42.160 --> 01:40:42.860
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: City o parang.

asr-001772
01:40:43.000 --> 01:40:46.400
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Kasi, ang laki ng portuna, tama po yun.

asr-001773
01:40:46.900 --> 01:40:48.540
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: At Diretso ng Marawi yan.

asr-001774
01:40:48.540 --> 01:40:50.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Please let us know, so that we can...

asr-001775
01:40:51.380 --> 01:40:55.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano natin yun eh, kailangan natin mag-accelerate ng spending.

asr-001776
01:40:55.780 --> 01:41:01.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi, after the flood control scandal, medyo bumagal.

asr-001777
01:41:01.140 --> 01:41:02.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, we need to accelerate spending.

asr-001778
01:41:02.660 --> 01:41:11.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But we need to pinpoint projects that will be contributory to nation building.

asr-001779
01:41:12.160 --> 01:41:14.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tulad po nito, hindi yung...

asr-001780
01:41:14.160 --> 01:41:15.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sorry po ha, may mga project kasi.

asr-001781
01:41:15.780 --> 01:41:17.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Parang pin-project lang, para alam nyo na.

asr-001782
01:41:17.460 --> 01:41:17.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi ko na alam.

asr-001783
01:41:18.020 --> 01:41:19.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ayoko nang mag-go into details.

asr-001784
01:41:19.540 --> 01:41:22.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But these are the projects that contribute to nation building.

asr-001785
01:41:22.880 --> 01:41:24.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito yung mga talagang sinusulong, tinutulak natin eh.

asr-001786
01:41:25.460 --> 01:41:25.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba na?

asr-001787
01:41:26.220 --> 01:41:27.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May returns to.

asr-001788
01:41:27.700 --> 01:41:28.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito yung may balik eh.

asr-001789
01:41:28.720 --> 01:41:31.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya kung even if it will cost some...

asr-001790
01:41:31.320 --> 01:41:32.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Of course, it will cost.

asr-001791
01:41:32.580 --> 01:41:38.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But I think that by being able to open a gateway,

asr-001792
01:41:39.220 --> 01:41:41.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: going to BAM, a conflict area,

asr-001793
01:41:41.700 --> 01:41:44.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that will create growth areas that will provide opportunities.

asr-001794
01:41:45.020 --> 01:41:46.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yan ang mga kailangan natin pagtulungan.

asr-001795
01:41:47.100 --> 01:41:49.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, probably, you can...

asr-001796
01:41:49.580 --> 01:41:52.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, yung part of your PAMAAN na projects,

asr-001797
01:41:52.180 --> 01:41:54.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung sa IINPA, baka tignan nyo kung pwede natin pagtulungan dyan.

asr-001798
01:41:54.840 --> 01:41:57.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We can also mint, if necessary.

asr-001799
01:41:57.680 --> 01:42:00.200
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: After our meeting, Your Honor, we'll brief you about it.

asr-001800
01:42:00.440 --> 01:42:01.560
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: I'll visit your office, Your Honor.

asr-001801
01:42:01.820 --> 01:42:02.080
OPAPRU Secretary Mel Senen S. Sarmiento: Thank you.

asr-001802
01:42:02.400 --> 01:42:03.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Likewise, yung ano po ron.

asr-001803
01:42:03.960 --> 01:42:07.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Napunta ko, Mr. Chair President, yung mga moski doon, magaganda.

asr-001804
01:42:07.660 --> 01:42:07.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba?

asr-001805
01:42:08.720 --> 01:42:11.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Napunta ako yung Pink Mosque and the others.

asr-001806
01:42:11.460 --> 01:42:11.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung...

asr-001807
01:42:11.700 --> 01:42:13.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Grand Mosque, no?

asr-001808
01:42:13.680 --> 01:42:15.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pa-picture nga ako sa harap nun, eh.

asr-001809
01:42:15.680 --> 01:42:17.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero medyo kailangan na nila.

asr-001810
01:42:17.380 --> 01:42:19.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They're requesting for rehabilitation.

asr-001811
01:42:20.140 --> 01:42:22.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we will help doon sa Pink Mosque, no?

asr-001812
01:42:22.740 --> 01:42:23.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pintura lang yun, eh.

asr-001813
01:42:24.140 --> 01:42:30.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And unting ano, I think it will be a good tourism destination, no?

asr-001814
01:42:31.560 --> 01:42:33.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's very unique, no?

asr-001815
01:42:33.340 --> 01:42:35.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung Pink Mosque, sa nga ba yun?

asr-001816
01:42:36.060 --> 01:42:36.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Magiging danaw din yun, eh.

asr-001817
01:42:37.760 --> 01:42:39.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mamaya, alam ko yung number niya, ano eh.

asr-001818
01:42:40.020 --> 01:42:41.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Alam ko saan si Mayor humihingi.

asr-001819
01:42:41.700 --> 01:42:42.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano, para mabuhay yun.

asr-001820
01:42:43.320 --> 01:42:45.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, these are the things that I noticed, no?

asr-001821
01:42:45.040 --> 01:42:47.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: When I had the chance to visit Barmen.

asr-001822
01:42:47.580 --> 01:42:49.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I would like to...

asr-001823
01:42:49.400 --> 01:42:54.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kami, Mr. Chair President, or authors of the Bangsa Mo Organic Law,

asr-001824
01:42:54.720 --> 01:42:55.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we want this to work.

asr-001825
01:42:55.580 --> 01:42:57.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sabi ko nga, kailangan natin dito follow-up ng development.

asr-001826
01:42:57.960 --> 01:42:59.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi pwedeng...

asr-001827
01:42:59.380 --> 01:43:00.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi naman makakain yung batas, eh.

asr-001828
01:43:00.920 --> 01:43:02.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Of course, it gave us time.

asr-001829
01:43:02.620 --> 01:43:02.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba?

asr-001830
01:43:03.120 --> 01:43:04.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May peace tayo, pero...

asr-001831
01:43:04.920 --> 01:43:08.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pag hindi natin na-follow-up yan ng trabaho, tanap buhay,

asr-001832
01:43:09.020 --> 01:43:11.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: eh, madali na naman manghikayat yan.

asr-001833
01:43:11.700 --> 01:43:16.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pag gutom yan, madali manghikayat sa kaguluhan yan.

asr-001834
01:43:16.340 --> 01:43:17.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba? Ganyan naman nangyari noon, eh.

asr-001835
01:43:18.080 --> 01:43:21.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero pag may trabaho, tanap buhay, hindi na yan mag-aarbas ulit.

asr-001836
01:43:21.800 --> 01:43:23.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, that's why I'm hoping itong...

asr-001837
01:43:24.540 --> 01:43:25.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Please, ano, yung...

asr-001838
01:43:25.340 --> 01:43:29.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Please check on that bypass road that I mentioned yun.

asr-001839
01:43:29.980 --> 01:43:30.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa may...

asr-001840
01:43:30.540 --> 01:43:35.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Open Maguindanao to Sultan Kudarat, sa BARMM area.

asr-001841
01:43:36.160 --> 01:43:38.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And, di ba, in tourism, no?

asr-001842
01:43:38.580 --> 01:43:40.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung sa Pink Mosque.

asr-001843
01:43:40.880 --> 01:43:41.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mura lang.

asr-001844
01:43:41.380 --> 01:43:41.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 9.2, no?

asr-001845
01:43:41.960 --> 01:43:42.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 5 million, no?

asr-001846
01:43:42.660 --> 01:43:44.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Baka pwede pa-sponsor na natin yun.

asr-001847
01:43:44.940 --> 01:43:45.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pink.

asr-001848
01:43:46.600 --> 01:43:48.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And among others, no?

asr-001849
01:43:48.220 --> 01:43:50.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung mga na-pick up natin doon.

asr-001850
01:43:50.340 --> 01:43:52.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, that's...

asr-001851
01:43:52.200 --> 01:43:53.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: These are the...

asr-001852
01:43:53.320 --> 01:43:55.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: These, I don't mind spending for infrastructure

asr-001853
01:43:55.960 --> 01:43:57.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: because these are really...

